        "biography": "Fran\u00e7ois Audouy\u00a0(French:\u00a0[odwi]; born June 17, 1974) is a French-American\u00a0production designer known for his work in feature\u00a0films,\u00a0television, and\u00a0music videos. He is a frequent collaborator with director\u00a0James Mangold, having designed\u00a0Logan (2017),\u00a0Ford v Ferrari\u00a0(2019), and\u00a0A Complete Unknown\u00a0(2024), among others. Audouy has received five\u00a0Art Directors Guild\u00a0awards for his work in production design.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Fran\u00e7ois Audouy, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.",
